   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Bosper jordbruksst&#xf6;d</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xf6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aim is to create rural employment, mainly by means of extension services to farmers regarding production and marketing of agricultural products. The work is implemented by an NGO Bosper in Tuzla, which emerged from the Lutheran World Federation program.</narrative>
